"About Us — Strategy & Local Execution in France and Europe — Acoeurs "
"Consulting"

#: templates/website/about.html:5
msgid ""
"Acoeurs Consulting 专注中国企业在法国和欧洲市场的进入、落地与持续运营，并为企"
"业主、投资人与家庭提供法国本地事务协调服务。"
msgstr ""
"Acoeurs Consulting supports Chinese businesses entering, establishing and "
"operating in France and Europe, and coordinates local matters for business "
"owners, investors and families."

