#: templates/website/about.html:34
msgid ""
"Acoeurs Consulting 是一家专注于中国企业国际化发展的咨询与落地执行机构，为客户"
"提供从欧洲市场评估、进入策略、本地化落地，到持续运营与业务拓展的全流程支持。"
msgstr ""
"Acoeurs Consulting provides consulting and local execution support for "
"Chinese businesses expanding internationally, from European market "
"assessment and entry strategy to local establishment, ongoing operations and "
"business development."

