msgstr "Long-Term Support"

#: templates/website/about.html:53
msgid "我们的定位"
msgstr "Our Positioning"

#: templates/website/about.html:54
msgid "连接战略判断与法国本地执行"
msgstr "Connecting Strategic Decisions with Local Execution in France"

#: templates/website/about.html:58
msgid ""
"Acoeurs 专注中国企业在法国和欧洲市场的进入、落地与长期发展。我们不仅协助客户"
"处理公司、合规或行政事项，也关注企业能否在当地真正开始运营并推进业务。"
msgstr ""
"Acoeurs supports Chinese businesses entering, establishing and developing in "
"France and Europe over the long term. Alongside corporate, compliance and "
"administrative matters, we focus on their ability to start operating locally "
"and move their business forward."

#: templates/website/about.html:61
msgid ""
"在跨境项目中，客户往往需要同时与不同机构、专业人士和本地合作方沟通。Acoeurs "
"负责需求梳理、信息协调和项目跟进，让中国管理层拥有一个法国本地沟通窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Cross-border projects often involve multiple institutions, professionals and "
"local partners. Acoeurs clarifies requirements, coordinates information and "
"follows up on projects, giving Chinese management teams a local point of "
"contact in France."

